zlib is compatible with built-in CMake targets:

  find_package(ZLIB REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ZLIB::ZLIB)

zlib provides pkg-config modules:

  # zlib compression library
  zlib

Custom TechSmith changes:
MSVC Windows dynamic builds use zlib1.dll / zlib.lib (release) and
zlib1d.dll / zlibd.lib (debug). MSVC static builds retain upstream archive
names libzs.lib (release) and libzsd.lib (debug).
